5.1 Build logs
pcluster describe-image -i &lt;IMAGENAME&gt;
pcluster list-image-log-streams -i &lt;IMAGENAME&gt;
pcluster get-image-log-events -i &lt;IMAGENAME&gt; --log-stream-name &lt;PCLUSTER_VERSION&gt;/1
where &lt;PCLUSTER_VERSION&gt; is the version reported by pcluster version.

5.2 Delete old images
pcluster list-images --image-status AVAILABLE | jq -r '.images[].imageId'
pcluster delete-image -i &lt;IMAGENAME&gt;
